      "sourceTextSha256": "c1b75a4af7e4cede557ae270b3d1588fd717a0293023546f2a8c9e19bca8899f",
      "text": "You will enjoy relaxation on the Caribbean beaches of Choroní, explore the tropical mountain landscapes of Henri Pittier National Park, and experience its spectacular scenery.\nYou will visit the world’s highest waterfall — Angel Falls, admire Canaima Lagoon, and walk behind the Sapo and Acha waterfalls.\nExplore Los Llanos, a true wildlife sanctuary and one of the largest bird reserves in South America.\nTravel through the Andean region with its lagoons and thermal springs, see a real Andean condor, and meet the special breed of Mucuchies mountain dogs.\nAlong the way, visit the famous Capilla de Piedras chapel and ride the Mukumbarí funicular, which stretches for 12.5 km.",
